o were in the houses near Micah’s house gathered together and overtook the children of Dan.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Job 5:4","note":"His children are far from safety. They are crushed in the gate. Neither is there any to deliver them,","source":"web"},{"ref":"Psalm 22:11","note":"Don’t be far from me, for trouble is near. For there is no one to help.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Proverbs 4:24","note":"Put away from yourself a perverse mouth. Put corrupt lips far from you.","source":"web"}],"related":[],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}